# Secretless AI Demo — credential scan showing what AI tools can see
# Run: vhs docs/demo.tape

Output docs/secretless-ai-demo.gif

Set Width 880
Set Height 450
Set FontSize 15
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Padding 15

Hide
Type "cd /Users/ecolibria/workspace/opena2a-org/test/hma && clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Type "npx secretless-ai scan"
Enter
Sleep 5s

Sleep 4s
